ch as zinc and chromium picolinate, chromium polynicotinate, niacin, pyrazinamide and isoniazid; alpha picolinic and dipicolinic acids; solvents comprising acetonitrile and valeronitrile; and lutidines and collidines for anti-ulcer drugs. The company was formerly known as Armour Polymers Limited. Resonance Specialties Limited was incorporated in 1989 and is based in Mumbai, India."}}